      "description": "Besides solvers, there are many other pieces of helpful software for solving SAT and related problems.\nMany complex problems can be solved by compiling the problem into a SAT encoding. Examples of domain problems which can be solved by reduction include planning problems (SATPLAN), automated theorem proving (via SMT), and formal verification (by bounded model checking).",
